{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A thrilling, fast-paced climbing game where players unlock different boons and choose diverse paths to ascend each climb. Control a character in the form of a ball and unlock permanent upgrades to enhance your gameplay. Navigate past various traps as you face the constant risk of falling back to the start.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Climbing Mechanics:</strong> Master momentum-based movement to scale handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression:</strong> Unlock <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> (e.g., double jumps, speed boosts, or wall jumps) to tackle increasingly difficult climbs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward:</strong> Choose between multiple paths\u2014some safe but slow, others laden with traps but offering unique power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Hazards:</strong> Dodge spinning traps, collapsing platforms, laser turrets, and environmental hazards that punish careless moves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> One wrong move could send you tumbling\u2026 but the thrill of the climb will keep you coming back!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3483330?t=1764893165","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764893165","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483330/1629a8526e9936fcb7119e6928a220828c28c708/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764893165","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483330/1629a8526e9936fcb7119e6928a220828c28c708/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764893165","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"descriptio